  "bodyHash": "fuQml/ZKJj0=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">此模組新增了 Fuze III 伺服器的內容</span></em></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><pre style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>⚠️此模組需要依賴 TCTCore⚠️</strong></pre><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1064329/description_3fbde43e-996c-4363-83ce-ed278caf2d56.png\" width=\"194\" height=\"194\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tct-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載連結</a></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>快速總覽</strong></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/729444/description_8a9dce2f-34ad-4da2-9daa-8907ca72d914.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">交易項目略有不同，因為我尚未添加所有用於製作的物品</span></strong></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/729444/description_4851ced0-555b-44dc-ba6a-e2bbb62700ac.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>與原版盔甲一樣進行合成</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/729444/description_5c93ece0-54fd-4142-9f96-34fbe47cc5b8.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">裝備也與原版一樣可以製作</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/729444/description_269c394a-45a9-47f2-946e-2ad187358e31.png\" width=\"329\" height=\"184\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/729444/description_4aa9536d-730e-4489-9fd2-86a7edcce0c2.png\" width=\"334\" height=\"183\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">錘子的合成方式與伺服器上的不同</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/729444/description_6a5efe89-1e71-4ac4-9778-29b2651ceaa5.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/729444/description_90d38a9a-61e2-4117-a418-7d4cca421b95.png\" width=\"302\" height=\"171\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Fuze III 音樂唱片僅能在創造模式下取得</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/729444/description_57f50f2a-f4e4-4476-9b1d-399ad2695965.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">以下是一些額外的合成配方</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rgYK0vvS618?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
